    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "This program currently classifies product reviews as positive or negative using a decision tree  classifier.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Run the program and see what the accuracy score is for the decision tree classifier.\r\n2. Replace the `DecisionTreeClassifier` with a `MultinomialNB` classifier (the `NB` stands for “Naive Bayes”).\r\n3. Re-run the program and see what the accuracy score is for the Naive Bayes classifier. Did the accuracy improve?",
